invariant: INV-36
file: chapulin.zig
catches: test/zig-build-check.sh
reason: Client.toCfg leaves ch_cfg.ticket_age_ms at 0, so C judges every
  ticket as one that arrived this millisecond and offers a stale ticket
  that RFC 9846 section 4.3.11.1 forbids. obfuscated_age still carries the
  age, so the hello looks right. unit.zig's field-by-field toCfg test and
  the stale-ticket rows of loop.zig object.

--- old
            cfg.ticket_age_ms = values.ticket_age_ms;
--- new
            cfg.ticket_age_ms = 0;
